  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Per ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "accessLevel": "",
        "id": "5ed02cb2dacd410c1f9e56ae",
        "text": "@Aaron Birkland"
       },
       "type": "mention"
      },
      {
       "text": ", \"it looks like fcrepo-http-commons and fcrepo-kernel-modeshape both pull in a JTA dependency: org.jboss.jbossts:jbossjta",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "\"However, it looks really old and unmaintained – the latest release is five years old: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.jboss.jbossts/jbossjta"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.jboss.jbossts/jbossjta",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "We should update to Modeshape's new recommended JTA, Narayana. The latest version is 5.7.0.Final.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
